'''''The Sun Also Rises''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In Our Time]].

==Steps==
# Head to the VIP Lounge Rest Area and find Dan Heng
# Speak with Black Swan
# Head to the VIP Lounge Rest Area and find Dan Heng
# Regroup with Himeko and Welt
# Go to the Lobby and meet with the IPC representative
# Speak with the IPC and Intelligentsia Guild representatives
# Return to the Astral Express
# Join the navigation meeting
# Speak with Black Swan and wait for the warp jump to begin
# (Optional) Speak with March 7th
# (Optional) Speak with Dan Heng
# (Optional) Speak with Boothill
# (Optional) Speak with Welt
# (Optional) Speak with Himeko

