::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, the IPC does see the big picture, huh?
:::'''Aventurine:''' "All in the name of peace" &mdash; that's our motto.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's in it for you guys?
:::'''Aventurine:''' To be honest, it does nothing to benefit the IPC... but it is extremely beneficial to the long-term development of the entire universe.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Doesn't that mean Aventurine took a hit for nothing?
:::'''Aventurine:''' Haha, if that's what it takes to bring peace to the entire universe, it's a price I'll gladly pay.
::{{tx}}
::{{tx}}
::<!--1-second delay-->
::'''Dr. Ratio:''' Has the IPC finished sharing all its thoughts? Then it's our turn.
::'''Dr. Ratio:''' The Guild, much like the Genius Society, has taken a keen interest in the recent calamity in Penacony. Ultimately, both parties have agreed to a comprehensive collaboration, offering technical support for the reconstruction of Penacony...
::'''Dr. Ratio:''' ...The floor is yours for the finer points, Mr. Screwllum. Enlighten us, please.
::'''Screwllum:''' Organic life's unrelenting search to understand the realm of inner spirituality is something I both admire and envy. Inorganic life has no mechanism to evoke dreams. But when my mechanical impulses are activated, my inspiration circuits will start to operate, and I will enter a state defined as "imagination."
::'''Screwllum:''' Every time, within the realm of imagination, there emerges a fire from the shadows. It is warm, bright. I frequently ponder, this flame might represent the essence of intelligence &mdash; a cluster of inspiration ignited by high temperatures. The future direction of the universe may well lie within it.
::'''Screwllum:''' Alas, they are nothing but projections of my thought system to me &mdash; desired, but unattainable. But after learning of Penacony's accomplishments, I have come to realize that the flame is not beyond my grasp.
::'''Screwllum:''' After deliberations with my partners, we have decided to defer the progress of the Simulated Universe project, and instead assist the Intelligentsia Guild as technological consultants in the research of the Dreamscape and Memory Zone, so that these assets may be better used to serve humanity.
::'''Dr. Ratio:''' Not only that, we've also established contact with the Garden of Recollection through the IPC, and they've pledged their support for our research endeavors...
::'''Dr. Ratio:''' I am truly happy for the Dreamchasers on Penacony &mdash; the cosmos's brightest and, let's admit, dimmer intellects are now at their service.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hooray! It's a big win for everyone!
:::'''Welt:''' But... *sigh* Never mind. At the end of the day, this is a positive outcome.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I keep getting this feeling that this is all too good to be true...
:::'''Welt:''' Agreed. It's hard to imagine members of the Genius Society taking an interest in such mundane research...
::{{tx}}
::{{tx}}
