:'''Black Swan:''' Hmm, never mind...
::'''Black Swan:''' I just... stumbled upon a particularly fascinating spot in your memory.
::'''Black Swan:''' Before I explain... I would like to apologize to you, (Trailblazer): This farewell gift I gave you isn't really a compass from the Memory Zone... but merely an {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|empty Light Cone}}.
::'''Black Swan:''' Remember when we entered the hotel in the Dreamscape for the first time, and I procured a few trinkets from your companions? Their functions are similar.
::'''Black Swan:''' This way, I can always be attuned to your location, ready to assist immediately if you encounter any threats.
::'''Black Swan:''' But... this is not its most intrinsic function.
::'''Black Swan:''' Light Cones are slices of light used to encapsulate {{Rubi|solidified phenomena|Remembrance}}. This empty Light Cone is the same.
::'''Black Swan:''' It can etch your memories in their most vivid form, and then... allow me to admire and manipulate them, turning them into unique mementos.
::'''Black Swan:''' All the world is born from the power of mind and soul, and that power is "memory." To prevent ourselves from being forgotten by the world, we must make the world remember us... or, use our memories to recreate it.
::'''Black Swan:''' Life, seemingly vast, offers but a scant collection of impactful memories: Some joyful, some sorrowful, some light, some heavy... But you, (Trailblazer), are different.
::'''Black Swan:''' Memory is a reflection of the future. Within that reflection, I see your unparalleled worth. You have the power to craft memories that can captivate the world... Your memory can illuminate the universe's future path.
::'''Black Swan:''' And that memory... will be as scintillating as the star clusters you see in this porthole.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Which is why you want to collect my memories?
:::'''Black Swan:''' Precisely. But, do you know the deeper meaning behind it?
:::You're making me blush...
:::'''Black Swan:''' How adorable. But, do you know the deeper meaning behind it?
:::Help me take a look, am I about to ascend?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're making me blush...
:::'''Black Swan:''' How adorable. But, do you know the deeper meaning behind it?
:::Help me take a look, am I about to ascend?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Help me take a look, am I about to ascend?
::'''Black Swan:''' The memories I have of you are not enough for me to predict a future that lies too far ahead.
::'''Black Swan:''' But, I can tell you one thing: My favor towards you stems from a more profound reason.
::'''Black Swan:''' The reason is simple: {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|In this grandiose and ostentatious dream of The Family's, only you personally experienced the entire course}}.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What does that mean?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Stop speaking in riddles!
::'''Black Swan:''' Patience, my friend. I will reveal the answer to you... but that time is not now.
